RESOLUTION NO. 1 OF THE FIRST BOARD OF DIRECTORS
WHEREAS the undersigned constitute the first board named in the Articles of Incorporation;
RESOLVED THAT:
(1) the incorporators' share subscriptions are accepted and shares set out in the subscription schedule are issued fully paid as approved by the Board;
(2) the registered office is at [street address], [city], Ontario, and the Secretary is directed to file statutory notices with the Companies and Personal Property Security Branch;
(3) [Name] is appointed President, [Name] Secretary, and [Name] Treasurer, each serving at the pleasure of the Board;
(4) ACH Direct and Airwallex mandates are authorized, with signing authority delegated to the President and Treasurer.
Dated at ______, Ontario, ______ 20___.
